  "slug": "crowdsec",
  "name": "Crowdsec",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Operational skill for installing, configuring, operating, and debugging CrowdSec (cscli, LAPI/CAPI, hub, bouncers, WAF/AppSec) across bare-metal, Docker, and Kubernetes.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, `crowdsec` (Use when the user is installing, configuring, operating, or debugging CrowdSec — including cscli, LAPI/CAPI, hub collections, parsers/scenarios/whitelists…), `crowdsec-service-api` (Use when the user wants to drive the CrowdSec Console **Service API (SAPI)** — the premium cloud REST…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install crowdsec@claude-plugins-official` from `crowdsecurity/crowdsec-skill`.",
